Subject: [PATCH] perf(picker): skip discarded unknown-provider hint and config
 deepcopies in model.options [daveey]

Warm model.options profile after #3345: is_runtime_provider_routable built a config-validation
hint (validate_config_structure x5) it threw away; four read-only config probes deep-copied the
merged config. Same decisions/output; guarded by test_picker_warm_cost_cuts + the 13-case matrix.
Worker-4 warm thread-CPU median 34.0 -> 27.7 ms.
